WEBVTT

00:11:28.705 --> 00:11:33.210
This whole process makes it look like
I think I'm a hero.

00:11:34.157 --> 00:11:38.852
So just in case there's any doubt
about the point that I'm trying to make,

00:11:38.876 --> 00:11:41.185
I want to apply these ideas

00:11:41.209 --> 00:11:44.056
in an area in which
I have zero credibility

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.796
and zero experience.

00:11:46.225 --> 00:11:48.249
I'm originally South African,

00:11:48.273 --> 00:11:51.323
and I'm deeply passionate
about wildlife conservation,

00:11:51.347 --> 00:11:53.283
most particularly rhinos.

00:11:53.648 --> 00:11:56.327
Those majestic creatures with big horns.

00:11:57.624 --> 00:12:00.569
Every day, three rhinos are killed,